{"product_id":"if-i-knew-you-were-going-to-be-this-beautiful-i-never-would","title":"If I Knew You Were Going To Be This Beautiful, I Never Would","description":"\u003cp\u003eA novel in stories about a young woman's coming of age during the summer of 1972 in a gritty, working-class community on the brink of gentrification traces her hedonist associations with friends and her struggles to understand her Vietnam-haunted crush.The summer of 1972. Katie and her town, Elephant Beach, are both on the verge: Katie of adulthood, and Elephant Beach of gentrification. But not yet: Elephant Beach is still gritty, working-class, close-knit. And Katie spends her time smoking and drinking with her friends, dreaming about a boy just back from Vietnam who's still fighting a battle Katie can't understand. No matter how beautiful some dreams are, there comes a time when we must let them go.\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 155 x 234\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Judy Chicurel\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9781472221667\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 336\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookloopbook.com","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45684551647385,"sku":"6RG9781472221667","price":20.0,"currency_code":"$","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/68af0022c4726_If_I_Knew_You_Were_Going_To_Be_This_Beautiful__I_Never_Would_Judy_Chicurel.jpg?v=1756577890","url":"https:\/\/bookloopbook.com\/products\/if-i-knew-you-were-going-to-be-this-beautiful-i-never-would","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}